<title>SOUTH AFRICA: ENVIROSERV , WASTE-TECH MERGER APPROVED.</title>
<headline>ENVIROSERV , WASTE-TECH MERGER APPROVED.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Waste management group Enviroserv Holdings Ltd said on Thursday that its merger with Waste-tech had been approved by shareholders and company had successfully issued shares for cash to raise 51 million r!nd for the enlarged group.</p>
<p>Formal clearance from government for the merger was expected shortly, it added.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
